# ======================= THE AIR WAR (HOI4: air zones, air wings, missions) =======================
# Planes fly in wings from air bases (each level of air base holds 200 planes) to the air zones - HOI4's
# strategic regions - in their range (map pixels x 7.114 km, as in HOI4). Every 4 hours the wings over a zone
# fight it out: fighters on Air Superiority and Interception shoot at everything the enemy flies there (HOI4's
# rules: attack against defence, better agility dodges up to 45%, more speed adds up to 65%, at most three
# planes on one target), ground anti-air hits the bombers, and the planes that get through do their job -
# close air support over the battles, bombing the factories, striking ships at sea and in port. Whoever holds
# the sky over a zone costs the other side's divisions there up to 35% of their defence and 30% of their speed.

